'' A SHARED FIXED ARRAY OF A CONSTRUCTED TYPE GIVEN VALUES -- 'arr()' for a bydesc constructor, '7'
'' for a converting one -- constructs each element from its value in the module initialiser
'' (fbc's structs/ctor_bydesc.bas). tiko declined the first and, silently, stored 7 and 8 RAW for
'' the second. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/shared-array-conv-list.bas -o tests/codegen/sharedarrayconvlist.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/sharedarrayconvlist.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 4-1-4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  70 80
